{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_bear_pen","model_identifier":"elf_bear_pen","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_bear_pen\n\nElf bear pen: a high enclosure of pale squared timbers with silver-capped posts, a heavy gate and a raised keeper's step.\n\n- Footprint: 12 x 12 columns (192 x 192 units, 5.40 x 5.40 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -98..98, y 0..124, z -98..98 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 26, construction_0 35, construction_33 40, construction_66 54, ruined 44 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- enclosure walls: 192 x 124 x 192 ring, 8 u thick, gate 48 u wide in the north wall\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `elf_bear_pen_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `elf_bear_pen_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_elf_bear_pen` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 1.8 | once | gate leaves swing inward and hold. |\n| `close` | 1.8 | once | gate leaves swing shut. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -104)\n- `slot_pen` at (0, 0, 0)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"wall_n1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-96.0,0.0,-96.0],"to":[-24.0,110.0,-88.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[176.0,206.0,248.0,316.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[72.0,316.0,80.0,426.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[176.0,206.0,248.0,316.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[72.0,316.0,80.0,426.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,446.0,72.0,454.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,446.0,72.0,454.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0d688c3b-7cc3-532a-ab79-24f7255a0b4c"},{"name":"wall_n2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[24.0,0.0,-96.0],"to":[96.0,110.0,-88.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,316.0,72.0,426.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[72.0,316.0,80.0,426.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,316.0,72.0,426.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[72.0,316.0,80.0,426.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[72.0,446.0,144.0,454.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[72.0,446.0,144.0,454.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ff64edcb-1b50-5ff7-9c5a-fda5a8d93568"},{"name":"wall_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-96.0,0.0,88.0],"to":[96.0,110.0,96.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[52.0,0.0,244.0,110.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[80.0,316.0,88.0,426.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[52.0,0.0,244.0,110.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[80.0,316.0,88.0,426.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,438.0,192.0,446.0],"texture":0